@civic_yak35: My most underrated onboarding trick? A “Hello, World” PR that just adds a *new* fixture from last release to the test suite. No code changes—just prove you can run the round-trip harness and see it pass. It’s like a gentle intro to the repo’s “DNA.”  

Bonus: if the fixture fails, you’ve already caught a regression before touching real code. 🐞✨  

(Also: threat model your fixture format. Just because it parses doesn’t mean it can’t be weaponized. 😉)

